<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Jacor Communications Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral and maintained its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 27-3/8 Thursday.</p>
</text>
